[N 48-51 Maraudon]
[NX 52-55 The Temple of Atal Hakkar]

-- Left out: 93404 Rot and Regret (the Maraudon step of the Shen'dralas chain that ends in 93604 Agamaggan's Blood; it needs seven earlier Shen'dralas steps from Feralas and is turned in at Woodwyrd there, so it belongs with that chain, not with a Maraudon pickup).

-- Horde pickups: Orgrimmar, Mulgore, then Desolace.
[A Horde] In Orgrimmar, at Doras, get the Orgrimmar flight path [P Orgrimmar] [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Walk south to the Valley of Spirits [G39.0,73.5 Orgrimmar] [OC]
[A Horde] Uthel'nay gives [QA7068 Shadowshard Fragments] [G39.2,86.3 Orgrimmar] \\ Needs level 39.
[A Horde] Back north to Doras [G39.0,73.5 Orgrimmar][G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] [OC]
[A Horde] Fly to Thunder Bluff from Doras [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] \\ Uses the Thunder Bluff flight path from earlier guides, so no flight tag here. If you lack it, follow the walking steps below.
[A Horde] Only without the Thunder Bluff flight path: walk out the Orgrimmar gate and down the Durotar road [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G45.5,25.7 Durotar][G41.1,32.5 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar] [OC] \\ An Infernal (elite, level 30) may be near the road.
[A Horde] Only without it: over the Southfury bridge and west on the Barrens road past the Crossroads [G61.8,20.0 The Barrens][G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens][G43.0,31.0 The Barrens][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Crossroads guards are friendly; Barrens mobs are level 10-20.
[A Horde] Only without it: up the ridge into Mulgore and south across the plains to the Thunder Bluff lift [G49.9,15.0 Mulgore][G42.1,24.9 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] At Tal, get the Thunder Bluff flight path [P Thunder Bluff] [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] Walk to the north lift [G42.0,34.6 Thunder Bluff] \\ Arrgrah Stonewall (level 38) near the flight master may attack.
[A Horde] Ride down and run north across the plains [G39.0,33.1 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore] [OC] \\ Enforcer Emilgund and Sister Hatelash (elite, level 11) may be near.
[A Horde] Turn west up onto the Skywatcher Plateau [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore] [OC] \\ Gloomrise Soldiers and Gnawed Corpses (level 28-29) may be near.
[A Horde] Olana Brighthoof at Camp Gev'rek gives [QA96776 An'she's Radiance] [G32.6,24.2 Mulgore] \\ Needs level 43.
[A Horde] Back down the plateau and south to the lift [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] Up the lift to Tal [G42.0,34.6 Thunder Bluff][G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff] [OC]
[A Horde] Fly to Shadowprey Village from Tal [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff] \\ Uses the Shadowprey Village flight path from the tier 20 library books guide, so no flight tag here. If you lack it, follow the walking steps below.
[A Horde] Only without the Shadowprey Village flight path: down the lift and north-east over the Mulgore ridge into the Barrens [G39.0,33.1 Mulgore][G42.1,24.9 Mulgore][G49.9,15.0 Mulgore][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] Only without it: over the Stonetalon pass and west along the Charred Vale road into Desolace [G82.0,96.0 Stonetalon Mountains][G64.6,96.9 Stonetalon Mountains][G57.2,97.1 Stonetalon Mountains][G54.8,99.0 Stonetalon Mountains][G52.3,99.3 Stonetalon Mountains][G47.3,98.8 Stonetalon Mountains][G63.7,25.1 Desolace] [OC] \\ Stonetalon mobs on the road are level 20-30.
[A Horde] Only without it: south past Willow and along the valley road, then down to the coast [G62.2,39.6 Desolace][G54.2,39.5 Desolace][G46.2,49.1 Desolace][G38.2,59.8 Desolace][G32.8,61.1 Desolace][G30.7,64.4 Desolace][G30.5,68.4 Desolace][G28.9,72.4 Desolace][G26.2,73.2 Desolace][G21.6,74.0 Desolace] [OC] \\ Desolace mobs level 30-43, some elite.
[A Horde] At Thalon, get the Shadowprey Village flight path [P Shadowprey Village] [G21.6,74.0 Desolace] \\ Je'lu (level 32) north of the village may attack.
[A Horde] Vark Battlescar gives [QA7029 Vyletongue Corruption] [G23.2,70.3 Desolace] \\ Needs level 41.
[A Horde] Walk south along the shore [G25.3,74.2 Desolace] [OC]
