-- Alliance pickups: Theramore, then Nijel's Point and down Desolace.
[A Alliance] In Theramore, at Baldruc, get the Theramore flight path [P Theramore] [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh] \\ Get to Theramore the way you know: a flight from Ratchet or Auberdine, or the Menethil boat.
[A Alliance] Archmage Tervosh in the Theramore tower gives [QA7070 Shadowshard Fragments] [G66.4,49.3 Dustwallow Marsh] \\ Needs level 39. QuestieDB flags a Theramore Guard (level 57) by the tower, and a Haggard-Looking Man (level 48) and Doctor Nimer (level 22) close by, as hostile.
[A Alliance] Back to Baldruc and fly to Nijel's Point [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh] \\ Uses the Nijel's Point flight path from the Scarlet Monastery Armory guide, so no flight tag here. If you lack it, follow the walking steps below.
[A Alliance] Only without the Nijel's Point flight path: fly from Theramore to Astranaar, then walk south through Talondeep Path [G34.5,48.0 Ashenvale][G39.0,61.0 Ashenvale][G42.5,71.0 Ashenvale][G78.0,42.0 Stonetalon Mountains] [OC]
[A Alliance] Only without it: down the road on the east side of Stonetalon to the Barrens pass [G79.5,60.0 Stonetalon Mountains][G84.1,74.8 Stonetalon Mountains][G81.0,78.5 Stonetalon Mountains][G78.5,80.0 Stonetalon Mountains][G76.1,83.2 Stonetalon Mountains][G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains][G82.0,96.0 Stonetalon Mountains] [OC] \\ Grimtotem and Venture Co. mobs (level 20-30) by the road.
