[A Alliance] Keeper Marandis gives [QA7065 Corruption of Earth and Seed] [G63.8,10.7 Desolace] \\ Needs level 45.
[A Alliance] Down the path south to the road [G64.2,18.5 Desolace] [OC] \\ Gritjaw Basilisks and Scorpashi Snappers (level 30-32) sit by the path.
[A Alliance] South on the road to Willow [G62.2,39.6 Desolace] [OC] \\ Bonepaw Hyenas (level 33-35) roam near Willow.
[A Alliance] Willow gives [QA7028 Twisted Evils] [G62.2,39.6 Desolace] \\ Needs level 41.
[A Alliance] South across Desolace to the Centaur Pariah [G51.0,66.7 Desolace][G50.5,82.7 Desolace] [OC] \\ The way passes the Mannoroc Coven demons and Burning Blade camps (level 36-40).

The Centaur Pariah gives [QA7067 The Pariah's Instructions] [G50.4,86.7 Desolace] \\ Needs level 39. He walks between here and about 43,85. Kaskk (rare elite, level 40), Whirlwind Shredders and Nether Sorceresses (level 32-40) may be near.
North across Desolace to Willow [G50.5,82.7 Desolace][G51.0,66.7 Desolace] [OC] \\ The way passes the Mannoroc Coven demons and Burning Blade camps (level 36-40).
[A Horde] Willow gives [QA7028 Twisted Evils] [G62.2,39.6 Desolace] \\ Needs level 41.
West toward the Valley of Spears [G54.2,39.5 Desolace][G46.2,49.1 Desolace] [OC] \\ Bonepaw Hyenas, basilisks, Dread Flyers and Whirlwind Stormwalkers (level 33-37) roam here.
On south-west [G38.2,59.8 Desolace][G32.8,61.1 Desolace] [OC]
Into the Valley of Spears to the cave mouth below the Maraudon cliffs [G29.1,62.5 Desolace] \\ Maraudine centaur (level 36-42) camp in the valley; Magra (elite, level 43), Ambereye basilisks and Ambershard Crushers and Destroyers (elite, level 40-43) stand by the way, and the Nameless Prophet (elite, level 41) by the cave mouth.
Cavindra, in the orange-crystal caves just inside, gives [QA7044 Legends of Maraudon] [G31.9,63.8 Desolace] \\ Needs level 41.

Outside the instance, in the Maraudon caves:
[A Horde] Kill Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers in the purple-crystal caves for 10 Shadowshard Fragments [QC7068 Shadowshard Fragments]
[A Alliance] Kill Shadowshard Rumblers and Smashers in the purple-crystal caves for 10 Shadowshard Fragments [QC7070 Shadowshard Fragments]
[A Horde] Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange-crystal pool [QC7029,2 Vyletongue Corruption]
[A Alliance] Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange-crystal pool [QC7041,2 Vyletongue Corruption]
Kill the Nameless Prophet in the outer caves and loot the Amulet of Spirits. Use it on the Khan spirits: three in the outer caves, one on the purple route and one on the orange route. Combine their gems with the amulet [QC7067 The Pariah's Instructions]

Inside Maraudon:
[A Horde] On the orange side, use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines and kill the Noxxious Scion that comes out; heal 8 vines [QC7029,1 Vyletongue Corruption]
[A Alliance] On the orange side, use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines and kill the Noxxious Scion that comes out; heal 8 vines [QC7041,1 Vyletongue Corruption]
Lord Vyletongue drops the Celebrian Diamond [QC7044,1 Legends of Maraudon] and Noxxion drops the Celebrian Rod [QC7044,2 Legends of Maraudon]
Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings; any Maraudon creature can drop them [QC7028 Twisted Evils]
Kill Celebras the Cursed where the paths meet; Celebras the Redeemed takes [QT7044 Legends of Maraudon] and gives [QA7046 The Scepter of Celebras]
Wait out his ritual and speak with him when it is done [QC7046 The Scepter of Celebras] [QT7046 The Scepter of Celebras]
[A Horde] Beyond Earth Song Falls, in the white-crystal chamber guarded by giants, take An'she's Radiance from the crystal near the top [QC96776 An'she's Radiance]
[A Horde] Kill Princess Theradras [QC7064 Corruption of Earth and Seed]
[A Alliance] Kill Princess Theradras [QC7065 Corruption of Earth and Seed]
Zaetar's Spirit appears after Theradras dies and gives [QA7066 Seed of Life] \\ Needs level 45. Optional: Keeper Remulos in Moonglade takes it; see the last step.

